+### Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=chartdb%2Fchartdb)
+
+Wasmer detects the Vite app, runs `npm install` and `npm run build`, and serves the generated `dist` folder as static files; diagram editing works without any environment variables. The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the configuration and click Deploy; it does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account.
+
+> **Note:** `VITE_*` variables are embedded in the built JavaScript and visible to every visitor, so do not set `VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY` on a public deployment. AI export runs in the browser; use the custom inference server option above with an endpoint that enforces its own access control.
+
 ## Try it on our website
 
